Day 58 - Public vs Private Subnet
Objective
Understand the difference between public and private EC2 instances.

Investigation
Created two EC2 instances:

One with a Public IPv4 address
One without a Public IPv4 address
Findings
The instance with a Public IP allowed SSH access.

The instance without a Public IP could not be accessed directly using SSH from the internet.

Key Takeaway
A Public IP address is required for direct internet access to an EC2 instance.
